The current source already configures AlarmKit’s Stop button as “Done” with a checkmark. I also found that snooze state lives outside the reminder row and reaches the card through a separate refresh path. I’m checking which dismiss surface could explain the reported X, and whether the three-minute ring window is an actual timeout or a reconciliation assumption.

