I found another display mismatch: native Later records “tap time + five minutes,” but usually keeps the already scheduled comeback at “original ring time + five minutes.” Those can differ. Card Done also has a separate gap for repeaters: it records completion without cancelling the ringing occurrence or its remaining comebacks.

