codex
The in-memory replay reproduced the card defect: a one-off changes from “Next in 1 min” to “Overdue” at the trigger timestamp, and only shows “Rings again” once the snooze snapshot reaches the resolver. A daily repeater advances to tomorrow while its current alarm would still be ringing. I’m consolidating the matrix, with unverified device behavior called out explicitly.

