- **Card state is computed, not driven by alarm lifecycle.** `nextDisplayDue` resolves live snooze → schedule grid → legacy `getReminderNextDueTimestamp`. Only incomplete **one-offs** become overdue, at `due.at <= now`, excluding live snoozes; overdue cards sort first. Repeaters instead advance through their grid. [lib/remindersMembership.ts:19](/C:/Dev/VR/lib/remindersMembership.ts:19), [lib/remindersMembership.ts:38](/C:/Dev/VR/lib/remindersMembership.ts:38)
